From b2f064204fd1a5013afe6d3ec8f392455863f72e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Pivoto <>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:45:41 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(nr-mac): add atomic slice PRB quota table

Per-S-NSSAI (optionally per-RNTI) downlink PRB quota restricted to
{24,52,78,106}, with TTL expiry back to 106, idempotent action IDs,
conflict detection for reused IDs and token-checked rollback. Writers
serialize on a mutex and publish through a seqlock so the scheduler hot
path only performs atomic loads.
